Package: pkgaudit
Title: Static Analysis Security Testing (SAST) for R Packages
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tyler", "Smith", , "tylerjssmith@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A static analysis security testing (SAST) tool for R packages.
    Flags security-relevant files and code in R source packages for manual
    review. Organizes results by R package lifecycle (build, check, install,
    load, attach, unload, detach), using file-context, code-context, and pattern
    rules stored in a versioned and hash-verified SQLite database.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
